---
import Icon from '@/components/brand/Icon.astro';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28" aria-labelledby="pilares-title">
  <SectionHeading
    id="pilares-title"
    eyebrow="Qué encuentras"
    title="Tres razones para entrar y quedarte"
    highlight="quedarte"
    intro="Cántaro es cafetería, tienda de objetos hechos a mano y taller creativo, todo en un mismo lugar."
  />

  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-6">
    <!-- Café -->
    <a href="/menu" class="bento reveal group relative overflow-hidden bg-paper p-7 pb-56 sm:p-10 sm:pb-64 md:col-span-4 md:row-span-2 md:min-h-[26rem] md:pb-10">
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-sm">
        <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-clay-500/15 text-clay-600"><Icon name="coffee" size={24} /></span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-medium sm:text-5xl">Café</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-bark-600">
          Tinto, capuchino, aromáticas y chocolate con queso para el frío del Valle. Siempre con una torta para acompañar.
        </p>
        <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-clay-600">
          Ver la carta <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
        </span>
      </div>
      <!-- Taza ilustrada -->
      <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-8 -bottom-12 w-64 text-clay-500 opacity-90 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-rotate-6 sm:w-96" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="100" cy="110" r="88" fill="#F1E2C8" />
        <path d="M78 52c-8-10 6-16 0-26M100 50c-8-10 6-16 0-26M122 52c-8-10 6-16 0-26" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".6" />
        <path d="M46 78h104v42a40 40 0 0 1-40 40H86a40 40 0 0 1-40-40z" fill="#FFFDF8" stroke="#5B3A21" stroke-width="4" />
        <path d="M150 92h10a16 16 0 0 1 0 32h-12" stroke="#5B3A21" stroke-width="4" />
        <ellipse cx="98" cy="80" rx="50" ry="8" fill="#7A5A40" />
        <path d="M88 79c4-6 16-6 20 0-4 4-16 4-20 0z" fill="#F8EEDD" />
        <path d="M64 112c10-8 20-8 26 0M106 120c10-8 20-8 26 0" stroke="#6E9E2E" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M30 172h140" stroke="#5B3A21" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
    </a>

    <!-- Artesanías -->
    <a href="/artesanias" class="bento reveal group bg-clay-600 p-7 text-cream-50 md:col-span-2">
      <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white/15"><Icon name="amphora" size={24} /></span>
      <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-medium text-cream-50">Artesanías</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-cream-50/90">Velas, esencias, textiles y cerámica hechos a mano.</p>
      <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
        Ver piezas <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={18} class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" />
      </span>
    </a>

    <!-- Talleres -->
    <a href="/talleres" class="bento reveal group bg-olive-900 p-7 text-cream-50 md:col-span-2">
      <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white/10 text-clay-300"><Icon name="palette" size={24} /></span>
      <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-medium text-cream-50">Talleres</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-cream-100/85">Una vez al mes aprendemos algo nuevo, juntos y con las manos.</p>
      <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-clay-300">
        Ver calendario <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={18} class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" />
      </span>
    </a>

    <!-- QR -->
    <div class="bento reveal flex items-start gap-5 bg-cream-100 p-7 md:col-span-3">
      <span class="grid size-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-paper text-olive-900 shadow-sm"><Icon name="qr-code" size={30} /></span>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">Escanea, elige y pide</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-bark-600">En cada mesa hay un código QR con la carta. Mírala con calma y haz tu pedido en la barra.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Regalos -->
    <a href="/artesanias#artesanias" class="bento reveal group flex items-start gap-5 bg-paper p-7 md:col-span-3">
      <span class="grid size-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-leaf-500/15 text-olive-700"><Icon name="gift" size={30} /></span>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">Un detalle para regalar</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-bark-600">Te ayudamos a armar un regalo con piezas hechas a mano y empaque especial.</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    border-radius: 2rem;
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgb(91 58 33 / 0.05),
      0 18px 40px -24px rgb(91 58 33 / 0.35);
    transition:
      transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1),
      box-shadow 0.35s;
  }
  a.bento:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-0.6deg);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgb(91 58 33 / 0.05),
      0 30px 50px -24px rgb(91 58 33 / 0.45);
  }
</style>
